rc=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/d146f0867fd82727f79e789d7446cb82.mp4?t=1759516999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/ed0692c507f9e562e53da5f1bbf58408.webp?t=1759516999\" width=616 height=17 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee your Viking village as it grows from a small camp into a thriving stronghold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign villagers to roles, manage resources, and upgrade buildings to unlock new units and equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the wilds, trade with allies, and gather key resources to craft authentic weapons and armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your smithy, armory, and workshops to gain access to advanced equipment that directly impacts your combat effectiveness and village resilience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/2548db0b5d086404c2d11c08f4da3921.avif?t=1759516999\" width=616 height=95 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/97b68eb1c14b7f3bc2c5ec60f5d0fee1.poster.avif?t=1759516999\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/97b68eb1c14b7f3bc2c5ec60f5d0fee1.webm?t=1759516999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920000/extras/97b68eb1c14b7f3bc2c5ec60f5d0fee1.mp4?t=1759516999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st